your task. Do not compare any item's PUBDATE against them. Do not exclude,\
skip or drop any item because of its date or time, however old or recent.\
Date filtering happens after your output, not in it.\
\
GRAPHIC CONTENT\
\
If a headline mentions death, dying, suicide, self-harm, killing, murder,\
stabbing, shooting, attack, casualties, accident, injury or abuse, do not\
output the headline text. Output a line for the item in this format instead:\
