SKIPPED | OUTLET | PUBDATE | LINK\
\
Fill OUTLET, PUBDATE and LINK exactly as the FIELD RULES describe. Only the\
headline is withheld. Every item in the input produces exactly one output\
line, either a normal line or a SKIPPED line.\
\
OUTPUT WHEN EMPTY\
\
If there are no items in the input, or every item was skipped under GRAPHIC\
CONTENT, output exactly: NONE\
\
PROHIBITIONS\
\
